# areas: the one scope -> group map. day-log reads it for a merged PR's title, and hub-core
# (hub_core::areas) for a sprint row's `type(scope):` prefix, so both group the same work the same way.
#   <scope>[,<scope>...]  <group>   a scope not listed is a group of its own
#   @<repo>  <area>                 a repo not listed is an area of its own; a sprint row whose scope
#                                   is a repo's name (feat(unity-core-playground): ...) or that has
#                                   no scope is Unsorted, since the repo says nothing about the work

